nplaced"},"tone":"annotation","variant":"subtle","visible":false},"id":"unplaced","type":"Badge"}]},"type":"CanvasStage"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"RootShell"},"name":"UX Flow player","spec":{"accessibility":["The path is a named navigation landmark whose current step is marked; the dock is a named group of controls reachable by keyboard.","The Restart, Exit and Comment controls keep their labels as accessible names when only the icon shows on a phone.","The Preview-unavailable notice is a status message in text, not a color.","Focus is a 2px primary outline on every control, and every control keeps a 44px target on touch tiers."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Stack, Text, Button, Badge, Icon, TextInput, Alert, ListItem, Breadcrumb, BreadcrumbItem, ContextBar, ContextChip, CanvasStage); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","The path is a Breadcrumb Widget of BreadcrumbItems, each with its number, Variant and View; the dock is the CanvasStage palette slot.","Every visible string is bound with $i18n except identities (View, Variant and Widget names, Event labels); en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","This View models the player only; the Workbench shell is shown by the Workbench View.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A person pressed Play on a Flow that has no problems (/flows/<flowId>?play=1); the player replaces the editor and starts at the Flow's entry step.","The base state is a just-started playback of \"Sign in and triage\": one step on the path, the sign-in View in the frame and one Next control; Variants advance it, end it, mark the Preview as unable to report Widget Events, or turn Comment mode on.","The frame shows a stand-in built from Widgets for the played View, which the live Workbench renders in the Preview; the render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme."],"intent":"Show the Prototype player of the Workbench as built from Adapter Widgets only: a person plays a UX Flow from its entry step, sees the path played so far, and follows each outgoing transition with a labelled Next control while the played View sits in the canvas frame.","interactionRules":["Playback starts at the entry step and shows the path played so far; earlier steps are history, not links, and the current step is marked.","Every outgoing transition of the current step is offered as a labelled, keyboard-reachable Next control, even when the Preview reports Widget Events.","A step advanced with a Next control rather than by the played View is marked on the path; a Workbench-driven advance is a player action, never an Event.","A step without outgoing transitions ends the Flow: the dock says so and offers Restart.","When the Preview cannot report Widget Events, the player says so and works through the Next controls alone.","Comment mode can be turned on during playback; it marks the canvas, shows its hint and lists comments that cannot be placed.","Restart returns to the entry step and Exit returns to the Flow editor."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the four core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"f10a5c02-3a6e-4c1d-9b0e-5d1c7e2a4f02"}],"requirements":["01a115cd-327f-7aa6-940d-3ef6749c4efc","01a11544-652f-7816-b08a-05c78c14797c","01a116f0-9016-75fb-90ff-ed86412b65a4"]},"variants":{"comment-mode":{"requirements":["01a11544-6585-7110-acc9-c3109c329f84"],"state":{"canvas":{"mode":"comment"},"comment":{"variant":"annotation"},"unplaced":{"visible":true}}},"end-of-flow":{"state":{"dock-end":{"visible":true},"dock-start":{"visible":false},"frame-resolved":{"visible":true},"frame-signin":{"visible":false},"path-end":{"visible":true},"path-start":{"visible":false}}},"events-unavailable":{"requirements":["01a11544-65f1-7a41-b331-53e818c4ee7d"],"state":{"events-alert":{"visible":true}}},"path-advanced":{"requirements":["01a11544-6559-753f-a9f8-dc8640332cb1"],"state":{"dock-advanced":{"visible":true},"dock-start":{"visible":false},"frame-inbox":{"visible":true},"frame-signin":{"visible":false},"path-advanced":{"visible":true},"path-start":{"visible":false}}}}}
